          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, select one enemy unit within 30” of and visible to this model. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time a friendly AERONAUTICA IMPERIALIS model makes a ranged attack against that enemy unit, re-roll a hit roll of 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
