            <profile name="Automated Emplacement" id="c378-3d7c-9cfe-0c05" hidden="false" page="77" publicationId="7573-8d1b-acdf-2de8" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model in this unit shoots, select one of the following keywords: INFANTRY; VEHICLE. Until those shots are resolved, when selecting targets for that model&apos;s attacks, you must select the closest eligible enemy unit with that keyword. If there are no eligible units with either keyword, that model must target the closest eligible unit instead. This unit never eligible to charge or Heroically Intervene, and cannot make pile-in or consolidation moves.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
