                <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time an attack is made with this weapon against a BUILDING, that attack automatically hits the target. Each time an attack made with this weapon targets a VEHICLE unit, that attack has a Damage characteristic of 6.</characteristic>
