            <profile name="Artillery and Crew (Heavy Quad Launcher)" id="1abf-ebda-e6c5-0c07" hidden="false" page="63" publicationId="7573-8d1b-acdf-2de8" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each Heavy Quad Launcher and its crew are treated as a single model for all rules purposes (crew models must remaining within 1&quot; of their Heavy Quad Launcher model). This means that the crew models cannot be targetted or attacked separately and that visibility and all ranges are measured to and from the Heavy Quad Launcher&apos;s model, not the crew models. This unit cannot Advance, is never eligible to charge or Heroically Intervene, and cannot make pile-in or consolidation moves.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
