              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each Medusa Carriage and its crew are treated as a single model for all rules purposes (crew models must remaining within 1&quot; of their Medusa Carriage model). This means that the crew models cannot be targetted or attacked separately and that visibility and all ranges are measured to and from the Medusa Carriage&apos;s model, not the crew models. This unit cannot Advance, is never eligible to charge or Heroically Intervene, and cannot make pile-in or consolidation moves.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
