          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, after your opponent uses a Stratagem (excluding Command Re-roll), the bearer can use this Relic. If it does so, until the end of the battle, the Command point cost your opponent must pay to use that Stratagem again is increased by 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
