          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">INFANTRY model only. Once per battle, in your Movement phase, the bearer can use this Relic. If it does so, remove the bearer&apos;s unit from the battlefield and set it back up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 9&quot; away from any enemy models. Until the end of that turn, you can re-roll charge rolls made for the bearer&apos;s unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
