          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the first battle round, select one enemy unit. Until the end of the battle, this WARLORD gains the following ability:

OLD GRUDGES (Aura): While a friendly PLATOON or BATTLE TANK SQUADRON unit is within 6&quot; of this WARLORD, each time a model in that friendly unit makes an attack against that enemy unit, add 1 to the wound roll.</characteristic>
