          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">During deployment, you can set up this unit riding around the flanks instead of placing it on the battlefield.  At the end of any of your Movement phases the unit can join the battle - set it up so that all models in the unit are within 7&quot; of a battlefield edge of your choice and more than 9&quot; from any enemy models.</characteristic>
