            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of your Shooting phase, select one enemy unit within 24&quot; of and visible to this model. Until the end of the phase, this model has the following ability: &apos;Enemy Sighted (Aura): While a friendly &lt;REGIMENT&gt; VEHICLE unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit makes an attack against that enemy unit, the target does not receive the benefits of cover against that attack.&apos;</characteristic>
