          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While this unit is within 6&quot; of friendly ASTRA MILITARUM ENGINESEER models, models in this unit have a Weapon skill and Ballistic skill of 4+ and have a Leadership characteristic of 9. In addition if your is Battle-forged, then for each ASTRA MILITARUM ENGINESEER model included in a detachment, one MUNITORUM SERVITORS unit can be included in that Detachment without taking up a Battlefield Role slot.</characteristic>
