          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When this model is destroyed, roll one D6 before removing it from play. On a 5+ it explodes, and each unit within 6&quot; suffers D3 mortal Wounds</characteristic>
