          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This model can transport 22 ASTRA MILITARUM INFANTRY models. Each Heavy Weapons Team and Veteran Heavy Weapons Team takes up the space of 2 models. Each OGRYN and BULLGRYN takes up the space of 3 models. If this model is equipped with Demolisher Cannon, it can transport 10 ASTRA MILITARUM INFANTRY models instead.</characteristic>
