                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">TANK COMMANDER model only.
- The bearer has a Toughness characteristic of 9.
- The bearer cannot lose more than 6 wounds in the same phase. Any wounds that would be lost after that point are not lost.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
